 "paragraphs": [
  "The young falcon found his family.",
  "“We were worried about you,” said the falcon's mother, “but we knew you would find your way.”",
  "The falcon squawked with joy. He explained how Aliya and Zade helped him solve the riddles and figure out the password. The family thanked Aliya and Zade and welcomed them to the celebration."
